<p>Gulshane panjetan ko loot liya<br />
Ek ghareebul watan ko loot liya</p>

<p>Koofiyo'n ne bula ke dhoke se<br />
Haaye shaahe zaman ko loot liya</p>

<p>Kalma padh padh ke haaye ummat ne<br />
Mustafa ke chaman ko loot liya</p>

<p>Karke paamaal laashae qasim<br />
Ek shab ki dulhan ko loot liya</p>

<p>Laashe akber utha ke sheh bole<br />
Mere sheeree'n suqan ko loot liya</p>

<p>Khaali jhoola jhula rahi hai maa<br />
Uske ghuncha dahan ko loot liya</p>

<p>Ek bhai ko zib'ha kar daala<br />
Ek bekas behen ko loot liya</p>

<p>Dashte ghurbat me cheen li chaadar<br />
Zainabe qastatan ko loot liya<br />
